'''G2 Esports''' is a [[:category:Germany|German]] professional esports organization located in [[wikipedia:Berlin|Berlin]] and founded in November 2013 by Carlos '''"[[leagueoflegends:ocelote|ocelote]]"''' Rodriguez. Besides hosting a [[:category:North America|North American]] ''Rocket League'' team, the organization also hosts squads in ''[[leagueoflegends:G2 Esports|League of Legends]]'', ''[[counterstrike:G2_Esports|Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'', ''[[valorant:G2_Esports|VALORANT]]'', ''[[hearthstone:G2_Esports|Hearthstone]]'' and ''[[rainbowsix:G2_Esports|Rainbow Six Siege]]''.

The organization renamed from '''"Gamers2"''' to '''G2 Esports''' as a part of their 2015 rebranding project. '''G2 Esports''' partnered with [https://stride.gg/ Stride Esports] on December 8th 2023, branded as '''"G2 Stride"''', lasting until October 2024.<ref name="stride">{{cite web|url=https://g2esports.com/blogs/news/g2-esports-partners-with-stride-esports-to-strengthen-the-future-of-rocket-league-esports-in-north-america|date=2023-12-08|title=G2 ESPORTS PARTNERS WITH STRIDE ESPORTS|author=[[G2 Esports]]}}</ref>

