*November 12th - [[Lachinio]] leaves [[G2 Esports]].<ref name="Lachinio leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Lachinio/status/797597913048383488|date=2016-11-12|title=I have left @G2esports on good terms with the players and the organization. It was a great experience. I will now be LFT for RLCS Season 3.|author=[[Lachinio]]}}</ref>
