*July 13th - [[Jahzo]] joins [[G2 Esports]] as their manager and coach.<ref name="Jahzo becomes coach">{{cite web|url=http://www.g2esports.com/g2-rocket-league-jahzo-manager|date=2017-07-13|title=G2 ROCKET LEAGUE TEAM WELCOMES JAHZO AS THE NEW MANAGER|author=[[G2 Esports]]}}</ref>
|content3=
