|content4=
*January 7th - [[Chicago]] joins [[G2 Esports]]. [[Kronovi]] leaves the roster.<ref name="chicago joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/G2esports/status/1082336062918209536|title=Welcome @Chicago_RL to our Rocket League roster. Time to take what’s ours|date=2019-01-07|author=[[G2 Esports]]}}</ref>
|content5=
*July 13th - [[G2 Esports]] signs a new multi-year deal with their current roster of [[Rizzo]], [[JKnaps]] and [[Chicago]], which keeps the squad with the club through 2022.<ref name="G2 deal 2022">{{cite web|url=https://g2esports.com/2020/07/13/g2-esports-triple-roster-renewal/|title=G2 ESPORTS TRIPLE ROSTER RENEWAL|date=2020-07-13|author=[[G2 Esports]]}}</ref>
*August 6th - [[Mile]] joins as a substitute.<ref name="mile joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/G2esports/status/1291434097164746757|title=Welcome @Mile1738 as our new sub for our Rocket League team!|date=2020-08-06|author=[[G2 Esports]]}}</ref>
*November 1st - [[Mile]] leaves the team.<ref name="mile leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/lukerl_/status/1323135494671290368|title=Team for RLCS X Winter Split: @LukeRL_ @ForkyRL @Mile1738 Team Name: Sippin' Ice Cubes|date=2020-11-01|author=[[Luke]]}}</ref>
|content6=
