*August 12th - [[dreaz]] joins [[G2 Esports]].<ref name="dreaz joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/G2esports/status/1425909966469312522|title=A SUB NO MORE.|date=2021-08-12|author=[[G2 Esports]]}}</ref>
*September 30th - [[Satthew]] joins [[G2 Esports]] as the head coach. [[Jahzo]] moves to an assistant coach role.<ref name="satthew">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/G2esports/status/1443682255130349576|title=RLCS has never been more free|date=2021-09-30|author=[[G2 Esports]]}}</ref>
|content7=
*January 2nd - [[dreaz]] leaves as he is traded to '''[[Team Envy]]''' for [[Atomic]].<ref name="envy atomic dreaz">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Envy/status/1477769170179833864|title=A new look for #NVRL|date=2022-01-02|author='''[[Team Envy]]'''}}</ref><ref name="g2 atomic dreaz">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/G2esports/status/1477769318825820163|title=TIME TO DOMINATE 20G2|date=2022-01-02|author=[[G2 Esports]]}}</ref>
*January 30th - [[Jahzo]] leaves [[G2 Esports|G2]].<ref name="jahzo">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/G2esports/status/1487162594754543626|title=One last dance|date=2022-01-28|author=[[G2 Esports]]}}</ref>
|content8=
*September 8th - [[Chicago]] is removed from the starting roster.<ref name="chicago inactive roster">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ChicagoRL/status/1700222475894927616|title=Restricted F/A|date=2023-09-08|author=[[Chicago]]}}</ref>
*October 22nd - [[G2 Esports]] parts ways with [[JKnaps]].<ref name="knapsack">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/G2RocketLeague/status/1716182717321384043|title=Today we part ways with the Knapsack.|date=2023-10-22|author=[[G2 Esports]]}}</ref>
