|content9=
*June 24th - [[Satthew]] extends his contract with [[G2 Esports|G2 Stride]].<ref name="sathextend">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/G2RocketLeague/status/1805281568275186072|title=Smurfed the Major so much that we had to extend his contract|date=2024-06-24|author=[[G2 Esports|G2 Stride]]}}</ref>
