'''NRG''', formerly known as '''NRG Esports''' and '''The General NRG''', is an [[:Category:United States|American]] esports organization formed after co-owners of the NBA's [[wikipedia:Sacramento Kings|Sacramento Kings]] purchased the [[leagueoflegends:LCS|LCS]] spot of [[leagueoflegends:Team Coast|Team Coast]]'s ''[[wikipedia:League of Legends|League of Legends]]'' team.

'''NRG''' became the third organization to win two [[RLCS]] World Championships on September 14th, 2025.

==History==
===Timeline===
{{tabs dynamic
|name9=2024
|name8=2023
|name7=2022
|name6=2021
|name5=2020
|name4=2019
|name3=2018
|name2=2017
|name1=2016
|This=9
|content1=
*October 1st - [[NRG|NRG Esports]] acquires the '''[[Kings of Urban]]''' roster.<ref name="NRG picks up KOU">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/782375002414813184|date=2016-10-01|title=Welcome @Fireburner_  @Sadjuni0r  and @RL_Jacob to the family as the new NRG Rocket League team!|author=[[NRG|NRG Esports]]}}</ref>
|content2=
*January 11th - [[GarrettG]] joins [[NRG|NRG Esports]].<ref name="GarrettG joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/819241279938760705|date=2017-01-11|title=We're psyched to add GarrettG to the #NRGRL team.|author=[[NRG|NRG Esports]]}}</ref> [[Sadjunior]] leaves.<ref name="Sadjunior leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/819242688730038274|date=2017-01-11|title=As a result, Sadjunior will be moving on the from org.|author=[[NRG|NRG Esports]]}}</ref>
|content3=
*January 8th - [[Jacob]] is released from the team.<ref name="Jacob leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/950466891230756864|title=It’s never easy to say goodbye.  Especially to someone who has become family. Jacob McDowell has been a huge part of our NRG team and Rocket League success.  We wish him the best in everything he does. Just remember @RL_Jacob, you will always be #NRGFam|date=2018-01-08|author=[[NRG|NRG Esports]]}}</ref>
*January 18th - [[jstn.]] joins [[NRG|NRG Esports]].<ref name="jstn joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/954077306896748546|title=Proud to OFFICIALLY announce the newest member to the NRG|date=2018-01-18|author=[[NRG|NRG Esports]]}}</ref>
*October 13th - [[Chrome]] joins [[NRG|NRG Esports]] as coach.<ref name="chrome">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ChromeRL/status/1051287901957513217|title=Thanks for allowing me to help you guys out :) @Its_JSTN @Fireburner_ @GarrettG|date=2018-10-13|author=[[Chrome]]}}</ref>
|content4=
*July 5th - Coach [[Chrome]] leaves the team.<ref name="chrome leaves">{{cite web|url=https://www.twitlonger.com/show/n_1squibg|title=Update regarding me and professional Rocket League|date=2019-07-05|author=[[Chrome]]}}</ref>
*July 7th - [[Fireburner]] retires from competitive play, remaining under contract with [[NRG|NRG Esports]] in an inactive position.<ref name="Fireburner announces upcoming retirement">{{cite web|url=https://www.twitlonger.com/show/n_1squa8k|title=<3|date=2019-06-27|author=[[Fireburner]]}}</ref><ref name="Fireburner officially retires">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Fireburner/status/1147929053703344128|title=Can’t be too upset with the loss grats to psg, didn’t expect to get nearly as far as finals but still happy with 2nd as my final result. Had a lot of fun all weekend and thanks everyone for all the support ❤️❤️❤️|date=2019-07-07|author=[[Fireburner]]}}</ref>
*July 25th - [[Turbopolsa]] joins [[NRG|NRG Esports]].<ref name="Turbo Joins NRG">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1154512698790432768|title=THE WAIT IS OVER! ANNOUNCING THE NEWEST MEMBER OF NRG RL...please welcome @turbopolsa to the #nrgfam :) |date=2019-07-25|author=[[NRG|NRG Esports]]}}</ref>
*September 5th - [[Fireburner]] is transferred to '''[[Cloud9]]'''.<ref name="C9 Fireburner">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1169658639277150208|title=a legend of the game and a huge part of #nrgfam history. good luck and thank you @fireburner_|date=2019-09-05|author=[[NRG|NRG Esports]]}}</ref><ref name="C9 Fireburner 2">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Cloud9/status/1169656531522117632|title=Known to turn 50:50s into 90:10s, please join us in welcoming Jayson @Fireburner_ Nunez to the #C9FAM as the #C9RL Coach!|date=2019-09-05|author=[[Cloud9]]}}</ref>
*October 14th - [[Sizz]] joins [[NRG|NRG Esports]] as coach.<ref name="Sizz coach">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1183837827466813441|title=ANNOUNCING THE NEWEST ADDITION TO OUR ROCKET LEAGUE TEAM...please welcome @sizz to the #nrgfam as our new coach :) #ALLDAYBABY|date=2019-10-14|author=[[NRG|NRG Esports]]}}</ref>
|content5=
*June 10th - [[NRG]] signs [[SquishyMuffinz]], [[Turbopolsa]] is moved to an inactive position on the roster.<ref name="nrg squishymuffinz">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1270807976979259393|title=Be careful! @SquishyMuffinz has officially joined the #NRGfam|author=[[NRG]]|date=2020-06-10}}</ref><ref name="turbopolsa inactive">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1270809025911775232|title=today we have made the extremely tough decision to move @turbopolsa to the inactive roster.|author=[[NRG]]|date=2020-06-10}}</ref>
*June 25th - [[Turbopolsa]] is transferred to '''[[Team Envy]]'''.<ref name="turbo nv">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Envy/status/1276311966768754689|title=4-Time World Champion and Winningest Player in Rocket League History.|date=2020-06-25|author=[[Team Envy]]}}</ref>
|content6=
*March 2nd - [[musty]] joins as substitute.<ref name="musty">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1366870983072747526|title=THE  NRG ROSTER UPDATE YOU'VE BEEN WAITING FOR|date=2021-03-02|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
*April 28th - [[NRG]] sells the naming rights of their ''Rocket League'' team to [https://www.thegeneral.com The General].<ref name="thegeneral">{{cite web|url=https://esportsobserver.com/nrg-rl-the-general/|title=NRG Sells Rocket League Team Naming Rights to The General|date=2021-04-28|author=[[Adam Stern]]}}</ref><ref name="nrg general">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1387474376967262208|title=bringing in the big man @SHAQ for the exciting announcement around NRG Rocket League’s new name and partnership|date=2021-04-28|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
*August 30th - [[NRG|The General NRG]] extends the contracts of their current roster consisting of [[GarrettG]], [[jstn.]], [[SquishyMuffinz]] and [[Sizz]].<ref name="thegeneral new">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1432416326044332038|title=We're happy to announce that @Its_JSTN, @GarrettG, @SquishyMuffinz & @Sizz have re-signed with the #NRGFam|date=2021-08-30|author=[[NRG|The General NRG]]}}</ref>
|content7=
*September 27th - [[musty]] leaves his position as substitute.<ref name="+jonny -musty">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/amustycow/status/1574778639324848128|title=gonna be stepping down from the sub spot on @NRGgg this season to focus on content & other business ventures|date=2022-09-27|author=[[musty]]}}</ref>
*October 16th - [[Sizz]] is removed from his coaching position whilst still under [[NRG]].<ref name="sizz cc">{{cite web|url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1InX5OFaMyM|title=What happened with NRG.|date=2022-10-16|author=[[Sizz]]}}</ref>
*October 19th - [[EPICJonny]] joins as coach.<ref name="epicjonny">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1582808955071664129|title=Push for Fall Major starts now. Welcome @EPICJonnyy as the coach of NRG Rocket League.|date=2022-10-19|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
|content8=
*June 30th - Coach [[EPICJonny]] is released.<ref name="jonny">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGcurrent/status/1674927061738086401|title=As our Rocket League season has now come to a close, we have made the decision to part ways with coach @EPICJonnyy.|date=2023-06-30|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
*July 5th - [[Squishy]] is released.<ref name="Squishy leave">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1676682896810328066|title=Today we bid farewell to @SquishyMuffinz|date=2023-05-07|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
*September 5th - [[justin.]] leaves.<ref name="jstn">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Its_JSTN/status/1699158549983625654|title=Unrestricted F/A|date=2023-09-05|author=[[jstn.]]}}</ref>
*November 12th - [[Fireburner]] joins as coach.<ref name="fire">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1723816865565221037|title=We have more than just one new addition today to NRG Rocket League...|date=2023-11-12|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
* December 15th - [[NRG]] acquire [[frosty]] and [[mist]].<ref name="frosty and mist">{{cite web|url= https://x.com/nrggg/status/1735752607300456791|title=New Team. Same NRG.|date=2023-12-15|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
|content9=
*January 21st - [[frosty]] is announced as part of '''[[The Snowmen]]''', thus removed from [[NRG]]'s starting roster.<ref name="frosty">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Scrzbblesrl/status/1749209658257023116|title=Announcing my new team for RLCS|date=2024-01-21|author=[[Scrzbbles]]}}</ref>
*January 23rd - [[frosty]] is released.<ref name="frosty out">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1749884991121596578|title=Before the start of our 2024 RLCS campaign, we have made the difficult decision to part ways with @frostyrl_|date=2024-01-23|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
*January 26th - [[Toastie]] joins.<ref name="toastie">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1751002376285082082|title=He brings the heat, we #BringTheNRG|date=2024-01-26|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
*February 27th - [[Toastie]] is released.<ref name="toastieout">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Toastie_RL/status/1762550617040474333|title=LFT as an Unrestricted F/A for split 2|date=2024-02-27|author=[[Toastie]]}}</ref>
*April 17th - [[Aqua]] joins.<ref name="aqua">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGgg/status/1780642440824725750|title=A new wave of NRG Rocket League is here|date=2024-04-17|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
*June 5th - [[mist]] is released.<ref name="mist">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NRGcurrent/status/1798444936163148132|title=As we move into our offseason period for NRG Rocket League, we have decided to release @mistRL from our starting lineup. We would like to thank Mist for his efforts throughout the past season for NRG RL, and we wish him the best in his next steps ahead.|date=2024-06-05|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
*September 27th - [[Aqua]] is released.<ref name="aquaout">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/NRGcurrent/status/1839713695892660288|title=Today we say goodbye to Aqua. Watching his growth has been a wild ride, and we know he's got a bright future ahead in Rocket League.|date=2024-09-27|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
