*December 20th - [[NRG]] acquire [[Atomic]], [[Beastmode]], [[Daniel]] and coach [[Satthew]].<ref name="BAD">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/NRGgg/status/1870182752722595842|title=Time to pass the keys Introducing a new era of NRG Rocket League @BeastModeLK @DanielRL__ @At0micRL|author=[[NRG]]|date=2024-12-20}}</ref>
