==Trivia==
* [[Team BDS]] is the first organization to win multiple RLCS LAN in the open era.
* [[Team BDS]] is the first organization to win multiple RLCS World Championships in the open era.
* [[Team BDS]] is the first organization to win multiple RLCS LAN in a season.
* [[Team BDS]] is the second organization with the most RLCS LAN wins (3), tied with [[Team Vitality]].
* [[Team BDS]] is the organization with the most World Championships wins (2), tied with [[Team Vitality]] and [[NRG]].
* [[Team BDS]] is the organization with the most RLCS Worlds Grand Finals appearances in the open era (3).

