|content1=
*March 19th - [[Team Falcons|Falcons Esports]] enter the ''Rocket League'' scene by acquiring '''[[Sleeping]]'''. [[Venom]], [[Ali]], [[trk511]] and [[faisal]] join, with [[Mr3zo]] as manager.<ref name="falcons">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FalconsEsport/status/1372988280162168839|date=2021-03-19|title=يسرنا الإعلان عن لاعبيننا الجدد فريق الصقور في لعبة Rocket League|author=[[Team Falcons|Falcons Esports]]}}</ref>
*June 29th - [[Eljabr]] joins as manager. [[Mr3zo]] leaves.<ref name="eljabr">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FalconsEsport/status/1412869790067216394|title=Our new Rocket League team manager|date=2021-07-07|author=[[Team Falcons|Falcons Esports]]}}</ref>
*August 6th - [[trk511]] leaves.<ref name="trk">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Trk511__/status/1423676064648339461|title=Left @FalconsEsport on good terms|date=2021-08-06|author=[[trk511]]}}</ref>
*August 22nd - [[Team Falcons|Falcons Esports]] acquire '''[[EMPTY]]'''. [[Smw]], [[Twiz]] and [[Impressive]] play under the name '''[[Green Falcons]]''' with the addition of [[Ali]]. [[Venom]] and [[Faisal]] move to '''[[White Falcons]]'''.<ref name="falcons 2021">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FalconsEsport/status/1429458400220532743|title=Please welcome our official Rocket League roster|date=2021-08-22|author=[[Team Falcons|Falcons Esports]]}}</ref><ref name="green white">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FalconsEsport/status/1432781244123820041|title=يُشارك صقورنا في دوري AFK MENA للعبة روكيت ليق بمجموع جوائز تصل الى عشرين ألف ريال|date=2021-08-31|author=[[Team Falcons|Falcons Esports]]}}</ref>
*October 16th - The '''[[Green Falcons]]''' roster is moved to the main team [[Team Falcons|Falcons Esports]].<ref name="falcons rlcs">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FalconsEsport/status/1449375946553835538|title=يشارك فريق روكيت ليق في تصفيات الاقليمية الاولى من بطولة RLCS|date=2021-10-16|author=[[Team Falcons|Falcons Esports]]}}</ref>
|content2=
