*April 1st - [[Team Falcons]] acquire [[Ahmad]], [[oKhaliD]] and [[trk511]]. [[Smw.]], [[Twiz]], [[Venom]] and [[Impressive]] leave.<ref name="srgfalcons">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FalconsEsport/status/1509965238925500422|title=Their journey continues as Falcons|date=2022-04-01|author=[[Team Falcons]]}}</ref>
*April 26th - [[Duggy]] leaves.<ref name="duggy out">{{inside source}}</ref>
|content3=
*January 25th - [[d7oom-24]] joins as substitute.<ref name="d7oom">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/id7oom_24/status/1618205232533745667|title=Joined @FalconsEsport as sub|date=2023-01-25|author=[[d7oom-24]]}}</ref>
*June 20th - [[Nick]] joins as coach.<ref name="nick">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FalconsEsport/status/1671115692785934338|title=We are happy to introduce our new Rocket League performance coach @NickOnRL|date=2023-06-20|author=[[Team Falcons]]}}</ref>
*August 18th - [[Nwpo]] joins.<ref name="nwpo">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FalconsEsport/status/1692582177274282301|title=HERE WE GO!! @Nwporl_ is a Falcon|date=2023-08-18|author=[[Team Falcons]]}}</ref> [[oKhaliD]] leaves.<ref name="khalid">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/AhmadRL_/status/1692586762692882616|title=After 5 years of being a teammate w @oNzxwi , it’s time for new challenges for both of us, he is to me more than a teammate, he is a brother and I wish him all the best |date=2023-08-18|author=[[Ahmad]]}}</ref>
*August 27th - [[Nick]] leaves. [[d7oom-24]] changes role from substitute to coach.<ref name="nick out">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NickOnRL/status/1695863791659913282|title=Thank you to @FalconsEsport for taking me in after I was kicked. I was truly at my lowest post Dig. This concludes my time with them, and I trust @id7oom_24 to take them even farther in the future. This is one of the saddest goodbyes, I’ve ever had.|date=2023-08-27|author=[[Nick]]}}</ref>
*December 9th - [[Rw9]] and [[Kiileerrz]] join.<ref name="twins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FalconsEsport/status/1733575690899919227|title=📣 T-R-K 📣|date=2023-12-09|author=[[Team Falcons]]}}</ref> [[Ahmad]] and [[Nwpo]] leave.<ref name="ahmad nwpo">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FalconsEsport/status/1733600349993263481|title=Official statement regarding our Rocket League roster|date=2023-12-09|author=[[Team Falcons]]}}</ref>
|content4=
*September 19th - [[Trk511]] leaves.<ref name="Trk511 out">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FalconsEsport/status/1969133691461935415|title=End of an era — Thank you Trk for leaving a mark that will live on with every Falcon|date=2025-09-19|author=[[Team Falcons]]}}</ref> [[dralii]] joins.<ref name="dralii in">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FalconsEsport/status/1969144481183043790|title=A new Falcon rises|date=2025-09-19|author=[[Team Falcons]]}}</ref>
