'''Team Vitality''' (formerly known as '''Renault Vitality''' prior to 2021) is a [[:category:France|French]] esports organization, which has teams competing in ''Rocket League'', ''[[counterstrike:Team_Vitality|Counter-Strike]]'', ''[[leagueoflegends:Team_Vitality|League of Legends]]'', ''[[valorant:Team_Vitality|VALORANT]]'', ''[[fifa:Team_Vitality|EA FC]]'' and ''[https://liquipedia.net/callofduty/Team_Vitality/Mobile Call of Duty Mobile]''.

'''Team Vitality''' became the first organization to win two [[RLCS]] World Championships on August 13th, 2023.

