==Trivia==
* [[Team Vitality]] is the first organization to win two RLCS World Championships.
* [[Team Vitality]] is the organization with the most RLCS World Championships wins (2), tied [[Team BDS]] and [[NRG]].
* [[Team Vitality]] is the second organization with the most RLCS LAN wins (3), tied with [[Team BDS]].
* [[Team Vitality]] is one of the three organizations to win multiple RLCS LAN in a season, the others being [[Team BDS]] and [[Karmine Corp]].
* [[Team Vitality]] is the first and only organization to win back-to-back RLCS LAN ([[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2022-23/Spring|RLCS 2022-23 Spring Major]] into [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2022-23|RLCS 2022-23 World Championship]]).

